{
  "$comment": "What a release snapshot ships (scripts/publish.mjs; lib/publish.mjs owns the shape; ROADMAP D2 and D4; m2-public-release.plan.md stage 2). exclude: contract-grammar globs that do not ship. replace: published path -> tracked source. patterns: machine-local shapes a shipped file must not carry. markers: placeholders that refuse a publish. The operator's identity patterns are NOT here: they live in the gitignored .claude/publish.local.json. allow: one entry per accepted hit, by file, pattern and line_sha256 (the hash of the line's trimmed text, which publish prints beside each finding), with its reason; an entry that matches nothing refuses the publish.",
